  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 94872708bfe9e4851981e9e1837f1ac3, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dragon
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  exhibitName: The Elder Scrolls Blades Ancient Dragon
  description: "The Elder Scrolls Blades Ancient Dragon is a very powerful dragon
    that appears in the mobile game The Elder Scrolls: Blades. It is one of the toughest
    enemies players can face, usually found in special quests and in the Abyss. Ancient
    Dragons come in two types: fire and frost, and they can breathe deadly elemental
    attacks. They are very large, winged reptiles and are considered legendary creatures
    in the Elder Scrolls universe. \n\nThese dragons are weak to slashing and shock
    damage, but they resist poison and cleaving attacks. When defeated, they drop
    valuable items like Dragon Bones, Dragon Scales, and Dragon Claws, which are
    used for crafting strong gear. Fighting an Ancient Dragon requires good weapons,
    armor, and strategy because they can also use lightning spells and fly during
    battle. \n\nAncient Dragons are iconic in Elder Scrolls lore, representing the
    ultimate challenge for players who want to test their skills against one of the
    most fearsome monsters in the game. "
  images: []
